## 17) Where to pick up next

Likely tracks:

1. **Threshold calibration for Front Snap** — capture 10–20 real kicks of varying quality, manually label, tune the 19 thresholds in `FrontSnapAnalyzer.ts`
2. **Real video replay** (pending product decision) — add `react-native-vision-camera`, record during kick, hold temp file, play under skeleton in review, drop on NEXT KICK
3. **Port Roundhouse + Side Kick** to the new `biomech.ts` + world-landmark engine using the same `CriterionResult` shape
4. **Settings UI** — add toggle for "Save kick replays" in Profile screen
5. **Technique videos** — bundle MP4 per kick type, add player screen wired to the "▶ Technique Video" link in the Train bottom sheet
6. **Kick history** — `KickHistoryScreen` exists as a placeholder; wire it to read `kicks` rows and let the user tap into a saved kick to open `KickReview`
7. **Android performance pass** — measure JS frame parse cost on real devices; consider moving to a JSI-based emit if it's bottlenecked
